      "body": "<p>Another option is the quarto extension <a href=\"https://github.com/coatless-quarto/toggle\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">toggle</a>.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://i.sstatic.net/2fHTrGVM.png\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\"><img src=\"https://i.sstatic.net/2fHTrGVM.png\" alt=\"toggle quarto extension preview\" /></a></p>\n<p>Or this minimal <a href=\"https://github.com/mcanouil/quarto-collapse-output\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">quarto-collapse-output</a> extension.</p>\n"
