      "is_rollback": false,
      "creation_date": 1775057440,
      "post_id": 79918495,
      "post_type": "answer",
      "revision_type": "single_user",
      "revision_number": 1,
      "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "body": "<p>A simple option for HTML documents is this:</p>\n<pre><code>&lt;details&gt;\n&lt;summary&gt;Click here&lt;/summary&gt;\n\n```{r}\nsessionInfo()\n```\n\n&lt;/details&gt;\n</code></pre>\n",
      "revision_guid": "F2379943-BAAD-4254-9DB4-2EB9CD00B5D6"
    },
    {
      "user": {
        "user_id": 1310511,
        "user_type": "registered",
        "display_name": "mindlessgreen",
        "link": "https://stackoverflow.com/users/1310511/mindlessgreen"
      },
      "set_community_wiki": false,
      "is_rollback": false,
      "creation_date": 1775057231,
      "post_id": 78854242,
      "post_type": "answer",
      "revision_type": "single_user",
      "revision_number": 2,
      "content_license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "body": "<p>Use <code>collapse=true</code> around the code chunk.</p>\n<pre><code>::: {.callout-note collapse=true}\n\nSession information:\n\n```{r}\nsessionInfo()\n```\n\n:::\n</code></pre>\n",
      "last_body": "<p>Use collapse=true as in {.callout-note collapse=true}</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://i.sstatic.net/657JMyXB.png\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">collapse=true</a></p>\n",
      "comment": "More explanatory, removed unnecessary external link to image.",
      "revision_guid": "B3C475B4-F9D3-48D0-AEC5-B93EE659BE33"
    },
    {
      "user": {
        "user_id": 13158728,
